  "label": "The woman is mapped as the recipient of undeserved social benefits",
  "description": "The top text 'how can this be allowed a free home and benefits?' is mapped onto the visual entity 'woman'. The text implies that the woman, as depicted in the image, is the one receiving social benefits, and the meme's hateful intent is to castigate her for this perceived undeservingness. The visual of the woman is used to represent the stereotype of a woman who receives government assistance, which is then contrasted with the man's sacrifice to reinforce the moral judgment.",
